## Interaction

Use semantic HTML, keyboard navigation, visible focus, and adequate contrast. Label controls and fields. Place validation errors beside fields. For asynchronous actions, keep pending state on the initiating control when possible; show global success only when the result is not already obvious, and avoid duplicate toast/banner feedback. Respect reduced motion.

